{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 12 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">去噪与图像恢复：残差、盲点与长程建模的假设边界</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Denoising &amp; Restoration</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_054_noise2self-title\">Noise2Self</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">通过 J-invariant 遮挡使单幅 noisy image 同时提供输入与 held-out 监督目标。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Formalizes single-image self-supervised denoising via J-invariant functions whose prediction for pixel subset J does not depend on the observed noisy values in J.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">单幅含噪图像 y</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Single noisy image y (no paired second scan and no clean ground truth)</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">由多次 J-invariant 预测聚合的去噪图像 x_hat</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Denoised image x̂ predicted from J-invariant masked neighborhoods</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.2</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.mlr.press/v97/batson19a.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_054_noise2self')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_054_noise2self')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"Noise2Self original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/55e5f4c88594f7d9bf5d.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.2</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_054_noise2self', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_054_noise2self\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_054_noise2self')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_054_noise2self', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_054_noise2self\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">单幅 y</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">唯一含噪观测，不需要配对或 clean target</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests single noisy image y (no paired second scan and no clean ground truth) and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"唯一含噪观测，不需要配对或 clean target\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests single noisy image y (no paired second scan and no clean ground truth) and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"单幅 y\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 01\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_054_noise2self', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">单幅 y</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">唯一含噪观测，不需要配对或 clean target</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests single noisy image y (no paired second scan and no clean ground truth) and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"把像素/体素索引划分为若干 held-out 子集\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Stage 02 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"索引分组 J\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 02\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_054_noise2self', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">索引分组 J</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 02</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">把像素/体素索引划分为若干 held-out 子集</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Stage 02 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"预测 J 时替换或移除 y_J，阻止信息泄漏\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs masked J within the core single image j invariant denoising computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"遮挡 J\" data-node-name-en=\"masked J\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_054_noise2self', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">遮挡 J</span><span class=\"lang-en\">masked J</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">预测 J 时替换或移除 y_J，阻止信息泄漏</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs masked J within the core single image j invariant denoising computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"f_theta(y) 在 J 上只能读取补集 J^c\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs J-invariant within the core single image j invariant denoising computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"J-invariant 网络\" data-node-name-en=\"J-invariant\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_054_noise2self', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">J-invariant 网络</span><span class=\"lang-en\">J-invariant</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">f_theta(y) 在 J 上只能读取补集 J^c</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs J-invariant within the core single image j invariant denoising computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"从邻域上下文预测被遮挡位置\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs held-out prediction within the core single image j invariant denoising computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"held-out 预测\" data-node-name-en=\"held-out prediction\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_054_noise2self', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">held-out 预测</span><span class=\"lang-en\">held-out prediction</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">从邻域上下文预测被遮挡位置</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs held-out prediction within the core single image j invariant denoising computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"仅在 J 上比较预测与原始 noisy y_J\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs self-supervised within the core single image j invariant denoising computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"自监督风险\" data-node-name-en=\"self-supervised\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_054_noise2self', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">自监督风险</span><span class=\"lang-en\">self-supervised</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">仅在 J 上比较预测与原始 noisy y_J</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs self-supervised within the core single image j invariant denoising computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"轮换所有 J 并拼回完整预测\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Grouped Aggregation to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"分组聚合\" data-node-name-en=\"Grouped Aggregation\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_054_noise2self', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">分组聚合</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Grouped Aggregation</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">轮换所有 J 并拼回完整预测</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Grouped Aggregation to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"单图像自监督去噪结果\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces denoised image x̂ predicted from j-invariant masked neighborhoods via x_hat.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"x_hat\" data-node-name-en=\"x_hat\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_054_noise2self', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>x_hat</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">单图像自监督去噪结果</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces denoised image x̂ predicted from j-invariant masked neighborhoods via x_hat.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"Noise2Self Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · J-invariant 单图像自监督风险</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · J-Invariant Self-Supervised Loss Equating Noisy Hold-Out Error to Clean Expected Risk</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Noise2Self：核心公式 · J-invariant 单图像自监督风险\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"54\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"30.531891pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.742477 -69.00913 218.735422 30.531891\" width=\"218.735422pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M4.158951-1.659233V-2.064984H.449225V-1.659233H4.158951Z\" id=\"m054_g8-0\"></path><path d=\"M3.506851-.057964V-.420242H2.130194C1.478094-.420242 .840485-.956414 .753538-1.68097H3.383676V-2.043248H.753538C.833239-2.731576 1.405639-3.303975 2.130194-3.303975H3.506851V-3.666253H2.159177C1.152044-3.666253 .376769-2.825768 .376769-1.862109S1.152044-.057964 2.159177-.057964H3.506851Z\" id=\"m054_g8-50\"></path><path d=\"M5.376205-.485452L5.339977-.557908C5.0284