 y=\"-51.467018\"></use><use x=\"32.187104\" xlink:href=\"#m054_g17-31\" y=\"-49.972637\"></use><use x=\"36.616693\" xlink:href=\"#m054_g14-50\" y=\"-52.07445\"></use><use x=\"41.00198\" xlink:href=\"#m054_g11-186\" y=\"-51.467018\"></use><use x=\"45.609695\" xlink:href=\"#m054_g17-57\" y=\"-49.972637\"></use><use x=\"51.078053\" xlink:href=\"#m054_g11-0\" y=\"-51.467018\"></use><use x=\"60.026661\" xlink:href=\"#m054_g20-72\" y=\"-51.467018\"></use><use x=\"65.939487\" xlink:href=\"#m054_g17-57\" y=\"-49.972637\"></use><use x=\"69.393237\" xlink:href=\"#m054_g5-1\" y=\"-59.061022\"></use><use x=\"73.109275\" xlink:href=\"#m054_g24-50\" y=\"-56.81166\"></use><use x=\"77.443021\" xlink:href=\"#m054_g5-35\" y=\"-68.453307\"></use><use x=\"83.616435\" xlink:href=\"#m054_g20-150\" y=\"-51.467018\"></use><use x=\"99.244437\" xlink:href=\"#m054_g20-109\" y=\"-59.00172\"></use><use x=\"106.58689\" xlink:href=\"#m054_g20-53\" y=\"-59.00172\"></use><use x=\"110.147043\" xlink:href=\"#m054_g17-92\" y=\"-57.507339\"></use><use x=\"115.423305\" xlink:href=\"#m054_g11-185\" y=\"-59.00172\"></use><use x=\"119.53787\" xlink:href=\"#m054_g20-72\" y=\"-59.00172\"></use><use x=\"124.339861\" xlink:href=\"#m054_g11-186\" y=\"-59.00172\"></use><use x=\"128.947576\" xlink:href=\"#m054_g17-57\" y=\"-57.507339\"></use><rect height=\".557905\" width=\"33.166808\" x=\"99.035223\" y=\"-54.306361\"></rect><use x=\"108.135853\" xlink:href=\"#m054_g20-109\" y=\"-44.632661\"></use><use x=\"114.143315\" xlink:href=\"#m054_g20-72\" y=\"-44.632661\"></use><use x=\"120.056141\" xlink:href=\"#m054_g17-57\" y=\"-43.13828\"></use><use x=\"136.164877\" xlink:href=\"#m054_g2-61\" y=\"-51.467018\"></use><use x=\"145.268445\" xlink:href=\"#m054_g27-48\" y=\"-51.467018\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">Noise2Noise 仍需同一解剖的第二个独立观测</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Noise2Noise still required two independent co-registered noisy acquisitions of the same patient or specimen.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">以 J-invariance 让预测某像素集合时不能读取该集合输入</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Partition pixels into subsets J and train a J-invariant network to predict pixels in J strictly from their complement J^c under pixel-wise independent noise.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">在条件独立零均值噪声下将单幅 noisy image 变成自监督风险</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Provides the rigorous statistical proof and optimal combination theorem for blind-spot single-image self-supervised denoising.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">可用于显微、PET、MRI 等无 clean target 场景</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Used in single-shot fluorescence microscopy, low-count nuclear medicine, and unrepeatable dynamic medical acquisitions.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">方法基础重要；空间相关噪声和孤立病灶可能被错误去除</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Theoretical cornerstone of blind-spot denoising; fails when noise is spatially correlated (e.g., FBP CT streaks) and can erase isolated 1-pixel micro-structures.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">J-invariance 禁止网络用某位置的噪声直接复制该位置，迫使其利用其他位置的信号相关性。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">当各位置噪声条件独立且零均值时，held-out noisy risk 可无偏估计监督风险。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">方法依赖数据冗余；孤立的小结构若无法由邻域预测，可能被平滑掉。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Partition pixels into subsets J and train a J-invariant network to predict pixels in J strictly from their complement J^c under pixel-wise independent noise.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Provides the rigorous statistical proof and optimal combination theorem for blind-spot single-image self-supervised denoising.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: J-Invariant Self-Supervised Loss Equating Noisy Hold-Out Error to Clean Expected Risk.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">适合无法获得重复采集或 clean target 的显微、PET、MRI 等场景。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">重建引入的空间相关噪声、条纹和各向异性会破坏条件独立假设，应按噪声相关长度设计 J。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Used in single-shot fluorescence microscopy, low-count nuclear medicine, and unrepeatable dynamic medical acquisitions.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Theoretical cornerstone of blind-spot denoising; fails when noise is spatially correlated (e.g., FBP CT streaks) and can erase isolated 1-pixel micro-structures.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.mlr.press/v97/batson19a.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Noise2Self: Blind Denoising by Self-Supervision</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/czbiohub-sf/noise2self\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
